      <div type="clause" n="7">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 7</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And wite Cristenra manna gehwilc, þæt he his Drihtene his teoþunge, a swa seo sulh þone teoðan æcer gegá, rihtlice gelæste be Godes miltse ⁊ be þam fullan wite þe Eadgar cyningc gelagode.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And every Christian man, in order to obtain the mercy of God, shall see to it that he duly renders his tithes to his Lord, namely, in every case, the produce of every tenth acre traversed by the plough, or else he shall incur the full penalty which King Edgar instituted by law.</ab>
      </div>
